 ## Settings
 Settings are stored on your SD card in `/_pico/settings.json`.  <!-- existing text -->
 
+### New (per-folder) options
+- `perFolderLayoutEnabled` – when **true**, changing display mode applies only to the **currently open folder** (exact path). When **false**, changes apply globally.  
+- `folderLayoutOverrides` – object mapping exact folder paths (e.g. `"/games/RPG"`) to a display mode: `HorizontalGrid`, `VerticalGrid`, `BannerList`, or `Coverflow`.  
+- `folderIconOverrides` – object mapping exact folder paths to a **theme icon variant** name. If the active theme does not provide the variant, the default compiled folder icon is used until you pick a replacement.
+
+**Reset actions:** In Settings, **Reset this folder to global** and **Reset all folders to global** are always visible. They are safe to use even when no overrides exist (no-op).
+
+> Display modes and locations follow the existing ROM browser layouts and settings file (see project README and Usage). 
+
