 ## Theme assets
 <!-- existing theme docs -->
 
+### Optional per-folder folder icon variants
+Place 4‑bpp raw textures and palettes in your theme:
+```
+/_pico/themes/<theme>/folder_icons/<name>.bin      # 64×64, 4‑bpp tiled (2048 bytes)
+/_pico/themes/<theme>/folder_icons/<name>Pltt.bin  # 16 colors, BGR555 (32 bytes)
+```
+Pico Launcher can assign these **per folder** from the UI (or via `folderIconOverrides` in `/_pico/settings.json`).  
+If a theme doesn’t provide a referenced variant, the **default compiled folder icon** is used.  
+Runtime loading mirrors how **Custom** theme assets like `gridcell*.bin` and `scrim*.bin` are loaded. 
+
